    {
      "id": "2026-10-23-s1",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "archive fashion",
      "title_zh": "老衣服的地方",
      "title_en": "The vintage place",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["这", "个", "星期", "，", "我", "去", "了", "一", "个", "买", "老", "衣服", "的", "地方", "。"],
        ["那里", "人", "很", "多", "。", "有的", "衣服", "非常", "好看", "，", "有的", "很", "老", "。"],
        ["我", "看到", "一", "个", "女生", "，", "她", "也", "很", "喜欢", "老", "衣服", "。", "她", "帮", "我", "找", "了", "一些", "。"],
        ["我", "试", "了", "试", "，", "都", "很", "好", "。", "最后", "，", "我", "买", "了", "一", "个", "包", "和", "一些", "衣服", "。"],
        ["她", "说", "：", "“", "下", "次", "我们", "一起", "来", "吧", "！", "”"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "This week I went to a place that sells vintage clothes.",
        "It was really busy. Some of the clothes were gorgeous, and some were really old.",
        "I saw a girl who also loves vintage clothes. She helped me find some.",
        "I tried them on and they were all great. In the end I bought a bag and some clothes.",
        "She said: “Let’s come together next time!”"
      ],
      "names": [],
      "new_words": ["星期", "好看", "女生"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "星期", "english": "week" },
        { "word": "好看", "english": "good-looking; nice" },
        { "word": "女生", "english": "girl; young woman" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-23-s2",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "travel",
      "title_zh": "雨天喝茶",
      "title_en": "Tea on a rainy day",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["上", "个", "月", "，", "我", "在", "北京", "。", "有", "一", "天", "，", "雨", "很", "大", "。"],
        ["我", "不", "想", "出去", "，", "就", "在", "一", "个", "小", "地方", "喝", "茶", "。"],
        ["那里", "的", "老", "先生", "跟", "我", "说", "了", "很", "多", "话", "。", "他", "教", "我", "怎么", "喝", "茶", "，", "我", "给", "他", "说", "了", "说", "英国", "。"],
        ["雨", "不", "大", "了", "，", "我", "也", "不", "想", "走", "了", "。"],
        ["我", "觉得", "，", "有", "雨", "的", "天", "也", "很", "好", "。", "下", "次", "去", "北京", "，", "我", "还", "要", "去", "那里", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "Last month I was in Beijing. One day it rained really hard.",
        "I didn't want to go out, so I drank tea in a little place.",
        "The old man there talked to me a lot. He taught me how to drink tea, and I told him a bit about Britain.",
        "When the rain eased off, I didn't want to leave.",
        "I think rainy days can be great too. Next time I go to Beijing, I want to go back there."
      ],
      "names": ["北京", "英国"],
      "new_words": ["雨", "茶"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "雨", "english": "rain" },
        { "word": "茶", "english": "tea" },
        { "word": "北京", "english": "Beijing" },
        { "word": "英国", "english": "Britain" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "missions": [
    {
      "id": "2026-10-23-m1",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "Arranging to meet",
      "role": "朋友",
      "goal": "Agree where and when to meet a friend tomorrow, and what to do if it rains.",
      "new_words": [
        { "word": "见面", "english": "to meet" },
        { "word": "地点", "english": "place" },
        { "word": "中间", "english": "in the middle; between" }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "partner_zh": "我们明天见面吧？",
          "partner_en": "Shall we meet up tomorrow?",
          "prompt_en": "Say OK, and ask where.",
          "answers_zh": ["好啊，在哪儿见面？", "好，什么地点？"],
          "answers_en": ["Sure, where shall we meet?", "OK, where?"]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "你家和我家中间有一个咖啡店。",
          "partner_en": "There's a café halfway between your place and mine.",
          "prompt_en": "Say great, and ask what time.",
          "answers_zh": ["太好了，几点见？", "好，几点？"],
          "answers_en": ["Great, what time?", "OK, what time?"]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "下午三点，怎么样？",
          "partner_en": "How about three in the afternoon?",
          "prompt_en": "Say three is fine.",
          "answers_zh": ["三点可以。", "好，三点见。"],
          "answers_en": ["Three works.", "OK, see you at three."]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "要是下雨呢？",
          "partner_en": "What if it rains?",
          "prompt_en": "Say it doesn't matter, you'll bring an umbrella.",
          "answers_zh": ["没关系，我带伞。", "下雨也没关系。"],
          "answers_en": ["No problem, I'll bring an umbrella.", "Rain's fine too."]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "好，明天见！",
          "partner_en": "Great, see you tomorrow!",
          "prompt_en": "Say see you tomorrow afternoon.",
          "answers_zh": ["好，明天下午见！", "明天见！"],
          "answers_en": ["OK, see you tomorrow afternoon!", "See you tomorrow!"]
        }
      ],
      "closing_zh": "拜拜！",
      "closing_en": "Bye!"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-23-m2",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "At a teahouse",
      "role": "服务员",
      "goal": "Come in out of the rain, order a small pot of green tea and ask where the toilet is.",
      "new_words": [
        { "word": "茶", "english": "tea" },
        { "word": "雨", "english": "rain" }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "partner_zh": "欢迎！外面下雨了，快进来坐吧。",
          "partner_en": "Welcome! It's raining outside — come in and sit down.",
          "prompt_en": "Say thanks, and ask what teas they have.",
          "answers_zh": ["谢谢。你们有什么茶？", "有什么茶？"],
          "answers_en": ["Thanks. What teas do you have?", "What tea is there?"]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "有绿茶、红茶和花茶。",
          "partner_en": "We have green tea, black tea and flower tea.",
          "prompt_en": "Say you'd like green tea.",
          "answers_zh": ["我要绿茶。", "来一壶绿茶。"],
          "answers_en": ["Green tea, please.", "A pot of green tea, please."]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "要大壶还是小壶？",
          "partner_en": "A big pot or a small pot?",
          "prompt_en": "Say a small one.",
          "answers_zh": ["小壶。", "小的就行。"],
          "answers_en": ["Small.", "A small one is fine."]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "好的。还要吃点什么吗？",
          "partner_en": "OK. Anything to eat?",
          "prompt_en": "Say no thanks, just tea.",
          "answers_zh": ["不用了，谢谢。", "就要茶。"],
          "answers_en": ["No thanks.", "Just the tea."]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "好，请稍等。",
          "partner_en": "OK, just a moment.",
          "prompt_en": "Ask where the toilet is.",
          "answers_zh": ["请问，洗手间在哪儿？", "厕所在哪里？"],
          "answers_en": ["Excuse me, where's the toilet?", "Where's the loo?"]
        }
      ],
      "closing_zh": "在右边。",
      "closing_en": "On the right."
    }
  ]
}
